### Note on `mysql-connector-j`

The MySQL JDBC driver is licensed under GPL-2.0 with the Universal FOSS
Exception, which permits its use alongside programs released under a
GPL-compatible license. This project is released under AGPL-3.0, and the driver
is used dynamically (never redistributed as part of this repository's source
code). If you prefer to avoid the GPL driver entirely, swap the dependency in
`backend/pom.xml` for `org.mariadb.jdbc:mariadb-java-client` (LGPL-2.1) —
it is protocol-compatible with MySQL 8 for the SQL used by this project.

